THIRD-PARTY DATA
----------------

The device agent embeds a projection (assignment prefix and registrant name)
of the IEEE Registration Authority's public MA-L, MA-M and MA-S listings,
https://standards.ieee.org/products-programs/regauth/, used to name the
manufacturer behind a hardware address. The snapshot was fetched on
2026-10-08. The data remains IEEE's; this entry is an attribution, and the
Apache License 2.0 of this repository grants no rights in it.


